"https://www.yakiniku-like.com/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6GUG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6017ddeb-5c25-4ad9-9feb-76710c96905e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://www.tendan.co.jp/ginza/menu_06.html\u003e\n確かに、1650円からだ","ts":"1629431442.159900","attachments":[{"fallback":"メニュー│焼肉の名門 天壇　銀座店","id":1,"title":"メニュー│焼肉の名門 天壇　銀座店","title_link":"https://www.tendan.co.jp/ginza/menu_06.html","text":"1965年 京都で誕生した「焼肉の名門 天壇」の味が東京銀座へ。地元のお客様のご支持とともに進化してきた伝統の味とサービスで素敵な時間をご提供いたします。ランチタイムには韓流ビュッフェをご用意しております。お昼のお食事にも是非ご利用下さい。","blocks":null,"service_name":"tendan.co.jp","service_icon":"https://www.tendan.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.tendan.co.jp/ginza/menu_06.html","original_url":"https://www.tendan.co.jp/ginza/menu_06.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TRjW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a073bdf3-4345-4b30-b25a-faa593d0f2fd","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"天壇ならランチで1500円前後だった気がする","ts":"1629431246.159500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2l8Q7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2510e2e8-c89a-415d-ad22-b5c048974248","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttp://www.yakiniku-like.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/menu-202107.pdf\u003e\n近所にこんなのができたので、行ってみたくはある","ts":"1629431209.159200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LYgh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71db517c-701b-4746-94af-35953532ceeb","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"おいくらですかね？ 1500円くらい？","ts":"1629431174.158700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zdz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ced1176a-a7a2-40a4-a052-f2215b54d569","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"天壇？","ts":"1629430982.158100","thread_ts":"1629430656.1